@startuml Reward Redemption Sequence

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Reward Redemption Flow

actor "Member" as Member
participant "Rewards Catalog" as UI
participant "API Controller" as API
participant "RewardRedemptionService" as RedemptionSvc
participant "PointsService" as PointsSvc
participant "RewardService" as RewardSvc
participant "ICustomerLoyaltyPlatformContext" as DB
participant "Event Publisher" as Events

Member -> UI: Browse rewards catalog
activate UI

UI -> API: GET /api/rewards/available?memberId={id}
activate API
API --> UI: Available rewards list
deactivate API

UI --> Member: Display rewards with\naffordability indicators

Member -> UI: Select reward to redeem
UI --> Member: Show redemption confirmation

Member -> UI: Confirm redemption
UI -> API: POST /api/rewards/{rewardId}/redeem\n{memberId}
activate API

API -> RedemptionSvc: RedeemReward(memberId, rewardId)
activate RedemptionSvc

RedemptionSvc -> RewardSvc: GetReward(rewardId)
activate RewardSvc
RewardSvc --> RedemptionSvc: Reward details
deactivate RewardSvc

RedemptionSvc -> RedemptionSvc: Validate reward available

RedemptionSvc -> PointsSvc: GetBalance(memberId)
activate PointsSvc
PointsSvc --> RedemptionSvc: balance = 1250
deactivate PointsSvc

RedemptionSvc -> RedemptionSvc: Validate sufficient points

RedemptionSvc -> PointsSvc: RedeemPoints(memberId, pointsCost)
activate PointsSvc
PointsSvc -> DB: Create PointsTransaction\nUpdate member balance
PointsSvc -> Events: Publish(PointsRedeemed)
PointsSvc --> RedemptionSvc: Points deducted
deactivate PointsSvc

RedemptionSvc -> RewardSvc: DecrementInventory(rewardId)
activate RewardSvc
RewardSvc -> DB: Update inventory
RewardSvc --> RedemptionSvc: Inventory updated
deactivate RewardSvc

RedemptionSvc -> RedemptionSvc: Generate redemption code

RedemptionSvc -> DB: Save RewardRedemption
activate DB
DB --> RedemptionSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

RedemptionSvc --> API: RewardRedemption
deactivate RedemptionSvc

API --> UI: 201 Created\n{redemptionCode, expiresAt}
deactivate API

UI --> Member: Display voucher with\nredemption code and QR

@enduml
